<div class="wf-wrap">
  <section>
    <span class="kicker">Lab · interactive model</span>
    <h1>Pipeline race: one row at a time against <span class="hl">whole columns</span></h1>
    <p class="sub">Two pipelines run the same six steps on the same table. The front track carries each record on its own and writes every step's result to staging. The back track reads only the columns it needs, moves them as tall batches across several cores, and never stops between steps. Press Start, then orbit the scene.</p>

    <div class="wf-stage" id="pr-stage">
      <canvas id="pr-canvas" aria-label="3D scene: two tracks run from a source table to a target table. On the front track single records hop from one staging pile to the next through six step gates. On the back track tall glowing column batches travel in parallel lanes through the same six steps without stopping."></canvas>
      <div class="wf-labels" id="pr-labels"></div>
      <div class="wf-views">
        <button data-pr-view="overview">Overview</button>
        <button data-pr-view="row">Row track</button>
        <button data-pr-view="columnar">Columnar track</button>
        <button id="pr-orbit" class="active" aria-pressed="true">Orbit</button>
      </div>
      <span class="wf-year" id="pr-clock" aria-live="off"></span>
      <span class="wf-hint">Drag to orbit · scroll to zoom · right-drag to pan</span>
    </div>

    <div class="wf-panel">
      <div class="wf-ctl">
        <label for="pr-rows">Rows in the table <output id="pr-rows-out"></output></label>
        <input type="range" id="pr-rows" min="0" max="100" value="74" step="1">
      </div>
      <div class="wf-ctl">
        <label for="pr-cols">Columns in the table <output id="pr-cols-out"></output></label>
        <input type="range" id="pr-cols" min="4" max="120" value="40" step="1">
